<title>SINGAPORE: YHS sees 1996 results not as good as 1995.</title>
<headline>YHS sees 1996 results not as good as 1995.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drinks firm Yeo Hiap Seng (YHS) said on Friday it did not expect its performance for the full-year 1996 &quot;to be as good as last year&quot; because of difficult market conditions in Singapore and China.  </p>
<p>YHS earlier reported a 17.1 percent year-on-year fall in its net profit for the six months to June 30, 1996, to Singapore $5.52 million.</p>
<p>A statement with the half-year results gave no further details of its expected future results.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
